{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01719","headline":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄篇二首 一 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄篇二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绣林锦野，春态相压。\n谁家少年，马蹏蹋蹋。\n鬬鸡走狗夜不归，一掷赌却如花妾。\n惟云不颠不狂，其名不彰。\n悲夫！。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01719.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01719","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}